SteerTTS C library (c/): CC BY-NC 4.0 + Whissle terms, see ../LICENSE (up to v1.2.0: MIT).

The code re-implements, from their public descriptions and reference implementations, the inference of:
- SteerTTS v1 and edge (this repository; weights CC BY-NC 4.0, see the model cards)
- Vocos (charactr/vocos-mel-24khz, MIT)
- all-MiniLM-L6-v2 (sentence-transformers, Apache-2.0) and its BERT WordPiece tokenizer (Hugging Face tokenizers,
  Apache-2.0; src/st_unicode_tab.c is generated by probing that library)
- WavLM-base-plus-sv (Microsoft, via microsoft/UniSpeech: CC BY-SA 3.0; a converted copy must keep that licence and
  attribution)
- the torch.randn CPU generator (PyTorch, BSD-3-Clause; the vectorized log/sin/cos follow the Cephes-derived
  avx_mathfun routines PyTorch uses, zlib licence)

tools/export_*.py convert those checkpoints to safetensors; the converted weights keep their original licences.
src/front/ is a C port of the edge text front end; it reads the same native/front assets, whose notices are in
../native/NOTICE (CMUdict, the g2p_en GRU, NLTK-derived tables, inflect).
